## 5. View Templates — Complete Breakdown

### 5.1 products.blade.php (Products List)

```
Layout: system-app
Breadcrumb: Filters → Search → Products

Components:
├── "Add Product" button
│     data-token="central_unique_products_a"
│     class="skeleton-popup" (opens add form via skeleton)
│
└── Products Table
      data-skeleton-table-set="central_unique_products_t"
      (auto-loaded by skeleton JS framework)
```

### 5.2 product_tables.blade.php (Product Detail)

```
Layout: system-app
Breadcrumb: Filters → Search → Product Tables / {company_name}

Components:
├── Company Header Card
│     ├── Banner image (static URL)
│     ├── Company logo (from li_logo)
│     ├── Product/Company name
│     ├── Tagline
│     ├── Stats: Lead/Contact count (clickable → scrolls to Contacts tab)
│     │          Technologies count (clickable → navigates to Related Products)
│     ├── Actions: "Show Tables" button, "Related Products" link
│     ├── Details: Industry, HQ, Employee Size, Website, Specialties
│     └── About section (with Read more/less toggle)
│
└── Tables Card (toggleable)
      ├── Companies Tab
      │     IF product_id → central_product_companies_t_{product_id}
      │     IF li_company_id → central_sun_master_accounts_t_{li_company_id}
      │
      └── Contacts Tab
            IF product_id → central_product_contacts_t_{product_id}
            IF li_company_id → central_sun_clients_t_{li_company_id}
```

### 5.3 related_products.blade.php (Related Products)

```
Layout: system-app
Breadcrumb: Filters → Search → Related Products ({company_name})

Components:
└── Related Products Table
      data-skeleton-table-set="central_unique_products_t_{pp_id}"
      (shows all products with same pp_name/li_smtp as the company)
```

