## 6. Complete User Journey — All Flows

### Flow A: Browse Products → View Product Details → See Companies and Contacts

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ STEP 1: Products List                                          │
│ URL: /filters/search/products                                  │
│ Token: central_unique_products_t                               │
│ Shows: All products in a table                                 │
│ Click: product_name "Salesforce" (product_id=123)              │
└────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │
                         ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ STEP 2: Product Detail Page                                    │
│ URL: /filters/search/product_tables?product_id=123             │
│ NavCtrl: products → sun.master_accounts via pp_name=li_smtp    │
│ Shows: Company card + Companies tab + Contacts tab             │
│                                                                │
│   Companies Tab (token: central_product_companies_t_123)       │
│   → products.companies = "101,205"                             │
│   → sun.master_accounts WHERE id IN (101, 205)                 │
│                                                                │
│   Contacts Tab (token: central_product_contacts_t_123)         │
│   → products.contacts = "1,5,12,99"                            │
│   → sun.master_leads WHERE id IN (1, 5, 12, 99)               │
└────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────┘
                         │
                         ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ STEP 3: Related Products                                       │
│ URL: /filters/search/related_products?pp_id={company.id}       │
│ NavCtrl: sun.master_accounts → products via li_smtp=pp_name    │
│ Token: central_unique_products_t_{pp_id}                       │
│ Shows: All products that share the same company SMTP           │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Flow B: From any Company Name link → Company View

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Click company_name link in any table                           │
│ URL: /filters/search/product_tables?li_company_id=456          │
│ NavCtrl: sun.master_accounts WHERE li_company_id=456           │
│                                                                │
│   Companies Tab: central_sun_master_accounts_t_456             │
│   → sun.master_accounts WHERE li_company_id = 456              │
│                                                                │
│   Contacts Tab: central_sun_clients_t_456                      │
│   → clients WHERE li_company_id = 456                          │
│                                                                │
│   Label shows "Leads" instead of "Contacts"                    │
│   (is_product_view = false)                                    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Flow C: From Companies tab → View a Company's Contacts

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Click "View Contacts" button on a company row                  │
│ URL: /filters/search/clients?li_company_id={li_company_id}     │
│ Token: central_sun_clients_t                                   │
│ Shows: All contacts/clients for that specific company          │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

